  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "38137562",
      "title": "Handling Actions Without createReducer",
      "lectureOrder": 694,
      "videoOrder": 639,
      "sourceHash": "be40ea9abbdbf0d8c14f97c7b3e68531c187978ab15d6a90840b886d5776eadf",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 4.86,
          "en": "So you now learn about actions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.86,
          "end": 8.67,
          "en": "Earlier in this section, you learn about reducers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.67,
          "end": 13.67,
          "en": "and this alternative way of defining your reducer functions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.13,
          "end": 18.87,
          "en": "And now I want come back to this alternative approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 18.87,
          "end": 21.33,
          "en": "I wanna redefine this reducer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 21.33,
          "end": 24.96,
          "en": "which now does contain some state changing logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.96,
          "end": 26.64,
          "en": "using this syntax,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.64,
          "end": 28.233,
          "en": "so without createReducer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.52,
          "end": 32.28,
          "en": "And I wanna do the same for the action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.28,
          "end": 36.6,
          "en": "and show you how you could build such a action thing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.6,
          "end": 39.84,
          "en": "such a action function as you learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.84,
          "end": 42.78,
          "en": "since this action is executed like a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 42.78,
          "end": 45.78,
          "en": "inside of the component that should dispatch it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.78,
          "end": 49.41,
          "en": "I wanna show you how you can build it without createAction.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.41,
          "end": 51.66,
          "en": "And of course, don't get me wrong,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.66,
          "end": 55.35,
          "en": "it's absolutely recommended to use createAction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.35,
          "end": 60.15,
          "en": "and createReducer unless you really don't like that syntax.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.15,
          "end": 62.55,
          "en": "But as you are using your knowledge",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.55,
          "end": 66.36,
          "en": "you gain in this course on real world projects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.36,
          "end": 70.71000000000001,
          "en": "you could encounter a project that does not use this syntax",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 70.71000000000001,
          "end": 74.19,
          "en": "that does not use createReducer and createAction.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 74.19,
          "end": 77.31,
          "en": "And that's why I'm showing you this alternative syntax,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 77.31,
          "end": 80.46000000000001,
          "en": "though I'm of course also showing this syntax to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 80.46000000000001,
          "end": 82.95,
          "en": "because it allows you to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 82.95,
          "end": 84.93299999999999,
          "en": "what's going on under the hood.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.37,
          "end": 88.62,
          "en": "So let's start with the reducer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.62,
          "end": 91.83,
          "en": "Instead of creating it with createReducer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 91.83,
          "end": 94.41,
          "en": "and by using this on function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.41,
          "end": 97.22999999999999,
          "en": "which is provided by NgRx store,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 97.22999999999999,
          "end": 101.00999999999999,
          "en": "you can create your reducer as a standard function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 101.00999999999999,
          "end": 102.393,
          "en": "as you learned before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.32,
          "end": 107.72999999999999,
          "en": "And now in a reducer where we don't just wanna return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 107.72999999999999,
          "end": 110.19,
          "en": "the state that we already have,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.19,
          "end": 114.39,
          "en": "you can accept a second argument in this reducer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 114.39,
          "end": 117.96000000000001,
          "en": "And that second argument simply is the action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.96000000000001,
          "end": 120.09,
          "en": "that wast has patched.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.09,
          "end": 124.098,
          "en": "Now in theory, a reducer can handle any action dispatched",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.098,
          "end": 126.93,
          "en": "anywhere in the application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.93,
          "end": 128.31,
          "en": "Of course, in this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 128.31,
          "end": 130.59,
          "en": "we only have one action thus far.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.59,
          "end": 132.78,
          "en": "But this could change over time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 132.78,
          "end": 135.72,
          "en": "So therefore to make TypeScript happy for now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 135.72,
          "end": 138.57,
          "en": "I'll simply set the type of action to any,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 138.57,
          "end": 140.73,
          "en": "though I will change this a little bit later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.73,
          "end": 143.22,
          "en": "I'm just doing this right now to make our life a bit easier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.22,
          "end": 144.87,
          "en": "for the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144.87,
          "end": 146.4,
          "en": "Now inside of the reducer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 146.4,
          "end": 148.5,
          "en": "we now wanna update the state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.5,
          "end": 151.11,
          "en": "depending on which action was dispatched.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 151.11,
          "end": 153.30599999999998,
          "en": "And if it's an action about which we don't care",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 153.30599999999998,
          "end": 158.30599999999998,
          "en": "in this counter reducer, let's say a user login action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 158.46,
          "end": 160.92000000000002,
          "en": "which has no impact on this reducer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 160.92000000000002,
          "end": 164.79,
          "en": "we wanna return the unchanged state instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.79,
          "end": 166.68,
          "en": "And keep in mind that state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 166.68,
          "end": 169.65,
          "en": "really only means this counter state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 169.65,
          "end": 172.44,
          "en": "for this slice of the overall store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 172.44,
          "end": 175.02,
          "en": "Keep in mind that the overall store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 175.02,
          "end": 178.77,
          "en": "is built by assigning reducers to keys.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 178.77,
          "end": 180.3,
          "en": "And then it's the combination",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 180.3,
          "end": 182.13,
          "en": "of all these different reducers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 182.13,
          "end": 183.93,
          "en": "that makes up the overall store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 183.93,
          "end": 187.38,
          "en": "But every reducer just handles its slice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 187.38,
          "end": 188.82,
          "en": "of the overall store,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 188.82,
          "end": 192,
          "en": "and it's the state of this slice that's managed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 192,
          "end": 194.83,
          "en": "by this counterReducer here, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 195.9,
          "end": 197.61,
          "en": "So therefore, here inside the reducer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 197.61,
          "end": 200.52,
          "en": "we wanna take a look at the action that was dispatched",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 200.52,
          "end": 205.44,
          "en": "and then determine if and how we want to handle this action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 205.44,
          "end": 208.26,
          "en": "And how can we take a look at the action?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 208.26,
          "end": 210.87,
          "en": "Well, for example, with an if statement.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 210.87,
          "end": 214.71,
          "en": "We could check if action.type.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 214.71,
          "end": 218.73,
          "en": "And keep in mind that actions created with createAction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 218.73,
          "end": 221.19,
          "en": "in the end will have such a type.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 221.19,
          "end": 223.2,
          "en": "Increment is a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 223.2,
          "end": 227.253,
          "en": "which when executed gives you an object that has a type key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 228.213,
          "end": 230.55,
          "en": "So we can take a look at that type",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 230.55,
          "end": 232.98,
          "en": "of that dispatched action object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 232.98,
          "end": 235.5,
          "en": "and we can check if the type here, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 235.5,
          "end": 238.53,
          "en": "is equal to Counter Increment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 238.53,
          "end": 241.32,
          "en": "So to this identifier, because this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 241.32,
          "end": 244.32,
          "en": "will be the type of the action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 244.32,
          "end": 247.23,
          "en": "The type of this action object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 247.23,
          "end": 250.71,
          "en": "So this type here will be counter increment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 250.71,
          "end": 253.31,
          "en": "You can also see this here in the preview in my IDE.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 254.73,
          "end": 256.11,
          "en": "So therefore, we wanna check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 256.11,
          "end": 260.28,
          "en": "whether the type is counter increment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 260.28,
          "end": 263.87,
          "en": "and we'll refactor this code to reduce the danger",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 263.87,
          "end": 266.43,
          "en": "of having a typo in here, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 266.43,
          "end": 267.63,
          "en": "in a couple of seconds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 267.63,
          "end": 270.33,
          "en": "But for the moment, that's what it is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 270.33,
          "end": 272.01,
          "en": "And then in here we know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 272.01,
          "end": 274.56,
          "en": "that we don't wanna return the unchanged state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 274.56,
          "end": 279.36,
          "en": "but instead here we wanna return the state plus one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 279.36,
          "end": 281.76,
          "en": "so the incremented counter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 281.76,
          "end": 283.56,
          "en": "And that's in the end what we're doing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 283.56,
          "end": 285.48,
          "en": "Though it should not be plus one of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 285.48,
          "end": 288.24,
          "en": "but instead action.value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 288.24,
          "end": 291.51,
          "en": "because our action can carry a value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 291.51,
          "end": 293.61,
          "en": "can carry the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 293.61,
          "end": 295.47,
          "en": "by which the counter should be incremented.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 295.47,
          "end": 298.89,
          "en": "And therefore, if the action is counter increment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 298.89,
          "end": 301.41,
          "en": "the new state that should be produced",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 301.41,
          "end": 304.41,
          "en": "by this counterReducer should be the old state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 304.41,
          "end": 308.763,
          "en": "plus the value that's included in the dispatched action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 309.72,
          "end": 312.84,
          "en": "On the other hand, if it's some unknown action type",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 312.84,
          "end": 315.6,
          "en": "or an action type about which we simply don't care",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 315.6,
          "end": 319.83,
          "en": "in this reducer, I returned the unchanged state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 319.83,
          "end": 323.1,
          "en": "And again, the state here is really just this slice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 323.1,
          "end": 325.923,
          "en": "of the overall store, this counter state here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 327,
          "end": 329.97,
          "en": "And that's how we could build the counterReducer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 329.97,
          "end": 332.67,
          "en": "without using createReducer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 332.67,
          "end": 337.33,
          "en": "If I restart this app after saving everything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 338.25,
          "end": 341.25,
          "en": "and I then visit local host 4200,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 341.25,
          "end": 344.433,
          "en": "you see that the Increment button still works fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 345.78,
          "end": 348.63,
          "en": "However, this of course is not everything I wanna do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 348.63,
          "end": 351.09000000000003,
          "en": "Instead, I mentioned that I also wanna show you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 351.09000000000003,
          "end": 353.46,
          "en": "how you can avoid createAction.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 353.46,
          "end": 356.37,
          "en": "And we'll then also come back to this code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 356.37,
          "end": 357.69,
          "en": "and improve it a little bit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 357.69,
          "end": 359.883,
          "en": "but let's start with the action here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
